* cc2: load step transient 10k<->120k (behavioral resistor, tanh-smoothed)
.inc models.inc
.param VS=3.3
V1 ta 0 {VS}
Rtop ta t 10k
Rb t 0 150k
Rsamp t sn R={10k+110k*(0.5+0.5*tanh(1e6*(V(ctl)-0.5)))}
Vctl ctl 0 PULSE(0 1 4.999m 2u 2u 5m 10m)
Rk1 sn x 2
Vsm x dd 0
M1 dd g b b nmosb
Rs b 0 150k
R1 vset ta 360k
R2 vset 0 200k
Xop vset b ta 0 g opa333t
.tran 0 15m 1m 1u
.options method=gear
.end
